            <div xml:id="d380">

                <pb facs="0339" n="329" xml:id="pg329"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.50/5–1749: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Consul General at Shanghai</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Cabot</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-05-17T19:00:00-04:00">May 17, 1949—7 p.
                            m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>971. Urtel 1656 May 16. Dept had assumed Deptel 918 May 12 furnished sufficient
                    authorization for action suggested final para ref tel. Assuming you will keep in
                    mind Embtel 1039 May 17 Dept authorizes you in your discretion approach
                    Nationalist milit authorities re demolitions Amer properties, including
                    utilities. If you consider desirable you authorized approach your Brit and
                    French colleagues with view their taking parallel action.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
